<title>HONG KONG: Prime Success unit sets US$16 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Prime Success unit sets US$16 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by arranger Rabobank Hong Kong branch.</p>
<p> BORROWER    GENTLEFIT TRADING LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTORS  CORPORATE GUARANTEE: PRIME SUCCESS INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>		 GROUP LTD, MODERN CITY DEVELOPMENT LTD,</p>
<p>		 AND JACARANDA INTERNATIONAL LTD.</p>
<p>AMOUNT/TYPE US$16 MLN, IN TWO TRANCHES</p>
<p>		 TRANCHE (A) US$10 MLN TERM LOAN, AND</p>
<p>		 TRANCHE (B) US$6 MLN REVOLVING CREDIT</p>
<p> MARGIN	L+150     MATURITY  3 YRS	AVGE LIFE  2.4 YRS</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	CALLS     NONE	 LAUNCHED   04.NOV.96</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN    MULTIPLE  HOME CTRY HONG KONG  GOV LAW    HONG KONG</p>
<p> AVAIL	 (A) 90 DAYS, (B) FROM LOAN AGREEMENT DATE UNTIL ONE</p>
<p>		 MONTH BEFORE MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> REPAYMENT   (A) FOUR UNEQUAL SEMI-ANNUAL INSTALMENTS AFTER 18</p>
<p>		 MONTHS' GRACE PERIOD, (B) BULLET</p>
<p> REPLIES     END NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES	 PROCEEDS WILL BE USED TO FINANCE THE GROUP'S</p>
<p>		 EXPANSION AND FOR GENERAL CORPORATE FUNDING.</p>
<p> ARRANGER   RABOBANK HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   COMMITMENT FEE    37.5BP</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS     US$3.5 MLN+   55BP   ALL-IN  172.92</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	    US$2.5 MLN    45BP   ALL-IN  168.75</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843 6960</p>
</text>
